                <p>
                  Created by certified Montessori teachers with years of real classroom experience, <a
                    href="https://www.edokiacademy.com/en/montessori-preschool" target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer">Montessori Preschool</a> is the most faithful digital adaptation of a
                  traditional <em>Casa dei Bambini</em> (ages 3–6) curriculum available today. It thoughtfully translates
                  iconic physical manipulatives, such as red-and-blue number rods, golden beads, sandpaper letters, and
                  color tablets, into a calm, structured digital classroom.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Why it stands out:</strong> The app covers four foundational areas of early Montessori
                  learning: phonics and reading, early mathematics, practical life skills, and creative arts. Children
                  can move freely around a virtual preschool and choose their own activities at a gentle, unhurried
                  pace. While it requires a recurring subscription, its pedagogical depth and attention to authentic
                  Montessori methodology are truly impressive.
                </p>
              </div>

