                <div class="app-review-header">
                  <div>
                    <span class="app-pick-pill neutral">Best One-Time Purchase Moveable Alphabet</span>
                    <h3 style="margin-top: 0.6rem !important;">3. Montessori Words &amp; Phonics (by L'Escapadou)</h3>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="app-specs-bar">
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-child"></i> Ages 3–8</span>
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-tag"></i> One-Time Purchase</span>
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-font"></i> Moveable Alphabet &amp; Reading</span>
                </div>
                <p>
                  If you want the classic Montessori <strong>Moveable Alphabet</strong> without a monthly subscription,
                  independent developer <a href="https://lescapadou.com/" target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer">L'Escapadou</a> offers <em>Montessori Words &amp; Phonics</em> and
                  <em>Montessori Crosswords</em> as straightforward, old-school one-time purchases.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Why it stands out:</strong> Built around proven phonics principles, the app helps children
                  spell and read over 320 words using a tactile Moveable Alphabet with traditional color-coded vowels
                  and consonants. Tapping an empty letter slot plays the isolated phonetic sound, guiding children to
                  hear how words are constructed before dragging the matching letter into place. It is completely
                  ad-free, works offline, and respects children's focus by avoiding stressful countdown timers.
                </p>
              </div>

