                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Why it stands out:</strong> Every animation is hand-drawn and every sound effect is recorded
                  from real acoustic instruments and physical wooden toys, creating a remarkably soothing sensory
                  experience. Because there are no levels, rules, or right-or-wrong outcomes, even 2-year-olds can play
